ence Lexington as locals do: great food, genuine neighborhoods, and the kind of unrushed rhythm that makes travel actually restorative. With Italian cuisine checked off, halal options for variety, coffee-and-games culture, scenic parkland, and spa rejuvenation all woven through three leisurely days, everyone's needs are honored. Pack your curiosity and appetite—Lexington is ready to surprise you.",
